ll (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Çünkü biz sizi, âlemlerin Rabbi ile bir seviyede tutuyorduk.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جبکہ انہیں رب العالمین کے برابر ٹھہراتے تھے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "karena kita mempersamakan kamu dengan Tuhan semesta alam\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِذْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نُسَوِّيكُم", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/806b53cf1b8c8484347f.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "smo vas izjednačavali", "en": "we made you equal", "tr": "sizi denk tutuyorduk", "fr": "nous vous égalions", "id": "kami menyamakan kamu", "ur": "ہم تمہیں برابر ٹھہراتے تھے", "bn": "আমরা তোমাদের সমান করেছিলাম", "fa": "شما را برابر می‌دانستیم"}}, {"text": "بِرَبِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "سَوَّيْتُهُۥ", "count": 2, "first": "15:29", "audio": "audio/02379808cff828ccbd21.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"]}], "gloss": {"en": "I fashioned him", "bs": "oblikovao sam ga", "tr": "onu şekillendirdim", "fr": "je l'ai façonné", "id": "aku telah membentuknya", "ur": "میں نے اسے بنایا", "bn": "আমি তাকে গঠন করেছি", "fa": "او را شکل دادم"}}, {"arabic": "فَسَوَّىٰ", "count": 2, "first": "75:38", "audio": "audio/9b4bba63b5ddb8624b67.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "so he/it fashioned", "bs": "pa je oblikovao", "tr": "böylece şekillendirdi", "fr": "alors il a façonné", "id": "maka dia telah membentuk", "ur": "پس اُس نے بنایا", "bn": "অতএব সে গঠন করল", "fa": "پس شکل داد"}}, {"arabic": "فَسَوَّىٰهَا", "count": 2, "first": "79:28", "audio": "audio/bc9c88f02a75ceb64ecd.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["hiya"]}], "gloss": {"bs": "i uredio